WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.950 --> 00:00:02.445
Your AI forgets.

2
00:00:02.515 --> 00:00:04.514
Long chats lose details.

3
00:00:04.583 --> 00:00:06.470
New chats start from zero.

4
00:00:06.691 --> 00:00:10.742
Meet RAMen: one memory for every AI you use.

5
00:00:10.962 --> 00:00:12.186
Tell Claude once.

6
00:00:14.355 --> 00:00:16.675
And ChatGPT already knows.

7
00:00:17.799 --> 00:00:22.064
Every note keeps a receipt: your words, the date, the app.

8
00:00:22.277 --> 00:00:27.593
And with selective memory, your AI pulls only what each answer needs, on demand.

9
00:00:27.827 --> 00:00:30.873
Long chat getting heavy? Keep going in a fresh one.

10
00:00:34.513 --> 00:00:37.147
Up to 83% fewer tokens.

11
00:00:37.565 --> 00:00:43.170
In Chrome, Detail Lock holds on to the details you set, and flags answers that drop them.

12
00:00:43.601 --> 00:00:45.336
It works in Claude Code.

13
00:00:46.234 --> 00:00:48.117
And on your own computer.

14
00:00:48.866 --> 00:00:52.110
You can see or delete everything on your RAMen page.

15
00:00:52.324 --> 00:00:55.406
Free to start. Pro is $1.99 a month.

16
00:00:55.869 --> 00:00:58.728
RAMen. More memory, fewer tokens.
